  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">South Africa - Responsible Global Supply Chains</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Wool Growers&#x2019; Association is the local implementation partner. Outcome 1: NWGA is better equipped to support emerging farmers and their constituent farmers associations; Outcome 2: The participative representative structures of communal wool farmers in the Joe Gqabi district in the Eastern Cape Province are strengthened and the participation of women is increased. Outcome 3: Increased income of communal wool farmers through improved quality and increased volumes of wool production.</narrative>
  </description>
